In less legal English: use it at home, let your staff enjoy it, or use it free
for background music in your pub or restaurant. Copy it, learn from it, fork it,
improve it and share it. Just don't sell SurroundCore, turn it into a paid
customer feature, or pass Kev n Chris's work off as your own. If you want to do
